Thus sequence for origin:
- attach task profile
- confirm preparedness
- activate origin node (sets ready true, occupied false)
- load origin payload (sets occupied true, locked true, cargo unavailable)
- unload origin payload (sets cargo available, confirmed true, locked stays true, occupied stays true)
Now we have origin prepared, task profile linked, vehicle allocated, origin_node_ready true, origin_node_occupied true, origin_availability_locked true, origin_availability_confirmed true.

Now we also need origin_availability_locked and origin_availability_confirmed (we have). Also need dispatch_allocated origin, dispatch_ready origin, dispatched origin.

Now destination similar:
- attach task profile
- confirm preparedness (need vehicle allocated)
- allocate vehicle beta to destination
- activate destination node (sets ready true)
- load destination payload (sets occupied true, locked true, cargo unavailable)
- unload destination payload (sets cargo available, confirmed true, locked stays true, occupied stays true)
Now destination prepared, vehicle allocated beta, node ready/occupied, locked/confirmed true.

Now we need to assemble transport leg and link loading container etc for shift_candidate_beta.

Goal includes transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_origin_linked to origin_node_alpha, transport_leg_destination_linked to destination_node_alpha, transport_leg_loading_authorized true, loading_container_leg_linked loading_container_beta transport_leg_alpha, loading_container_loaded loading_container_beta.

